/-!
# Concrete matrix data for a Lyons elementary eight

For the actual max4 words x and y, the elements (x²y⁴)⁴, (xy²xyx)³,
and t=x⁷ are independent commuting involutions. The tables below record
short word products. The carry-free checker proves each matrix equation.
Balanced row lookup and literal row lists keep the kernel reductions bounded.
Source: ATLAS LyG1-max4W1; Aschbacher–Smith A.2.12, printed p.36.
-/
